                  <resetValue>0x1</resetValue>
                  <documentation>This field is used by the controller to calculate read transaction crossing page boundary.
It is valid only when PROFILE 2 - HF is selected.
Allowed values are:
[list]
[*] 1&apos;b0 - Disable,
[*] 1&apos;b1 - Enable.
[/list]</documentation>
                  <readBehavior>None</readBehavior>
                  <writeBehavior>None</writeBehavior>
